From 978029b75c5b814f1d081b884075ad52167e2d69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:41:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] The new rows' support techniques: healing with its limits,
 Defense and Speed up, and a Defense-lowering technique that works once per
 fighter

---
